   <media:description>The Balenciaga ateliers explore the expressive potential of material through invisible construction and collaborative savoir-faire. From ultralight silk mousseline assembled as a single continuous garment to sculptural pleating developed with Maison du Pli and Karen Grigorian, each look reflects a shared pursuit of technical innovation.

Discover the 55th Couture Collection on https://www.balenciaga.com/show-couture55

