   <media:description>At the Balenciaga Couture atelier, archival inspiration is translated through experimentation. Combining a 3D body scan with the precision of tailoring and Couture, the molding looks use leather as a hidden architecture, preserving sculptural volumes while redefining the relationship between garment and body.

Discover the 55th Couture Collection on https://www.balenciaga.com/show-couture55

